<title>USA: Cincinnati Milacron Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Cincinnati Milacron Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.47		    $0.46</p>
<p> Net			  19,100		   16,000</p>
<p> Revs			511,100		  486,500</p>
<p>			9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			   $1.23		    $1.08</p>
<p> Net			  46,400		   37,400</p>
<p> Revs		    1,275,900		1,231,400</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine months 1995 net includes $0.23/shr integration charge and $0.12/shr gain on American Mine Tool business.</p>
<p>Q3 is 16 weeks and nine months is 40 weeks.</p>
<p>Periods ended Oct 5, 1996 and Oct 7, 1995.</p>
